# Auth

## Overview

Owns session lifetime and the token check that runs before a handler.

## Layout

### `src/auth`

Holds the session module, where `src/auth/session.ts` sets the session lifetime.

## Gotchas

- A session outlives its token by the lifetime in `src/auth/session.ts`, so a revoked token still reads as signed in until the session expires
